abstract: >-
  Complete lists of representatives of the conjugacy classes of subgroups of
  the symmetric groups S_n for n <= 21, with the code that computed them.
  The computation extends OEIS A000638 (a(19) = 16,745,233,
  a(20) = 104,994,596, a(21) = 245,393,739) and A000637, and gives new terms
  of the labelled sequences A005432 and A116693 for n = 19..21.
keywords:
  - symmetric group
  - conjugacy classes of subgroups
  - permutation groups
  - computational group theory
  - GAP
  - OEIS A000638
